  "description": "This NuGet package is an all-in-one utility library designed to streamline development for Microsoft Dynamics 365 (CRM). It provides a rich set of reusable functions and abstractions that simplify complex and repetitive tasks across the Dynamics platform.\n\nKey features include:\n\nCRUD Operations: Simplified methods for creating, retrieving, updating, and deleting records across all standard and custom entities.\n\nWorkflow Control: Easily activate, deactivate, and trigger on-demand workflows.\n\nSecurity Management: Retrieve and manage security roles and user-role assignments.\n\nMetadata Access: Fetch option set values, lookup configurations, and entity metadata.\n\nUtility Methods: Helper functions for working with EntityReference, QueryExpression, FetchXML, and more.\n\nError Handling: Consistent exception wrapping and logging support for easier debugging.\n\nCompatibility: Works with both Dynamics 365 Online environments.\n\nWhether you're building plugins, custom workflow activities, console apps, or integration tools, this package provides a reliable foundation to accelerate Dynamics CRM development and reduce boilerplate code.",
